---
// blurt: own your social publishing, markdown in -> posts everywhere. Recreated
// as its brutalist terminal: hard edges, blueprint grid, monolith shadow.
---
<div class="scene scene--blurt" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="blurt-term">
    <div class="blurt-bar">
      <span class="blurt-sq"></span><span class="blurt-sq"></span><span class="blurt-sq"></span>
      <span class="blurt-path">terminal://blurt.sh</span>
    </div>
    <pre class="blurt-body"><span class="ln"><span class="pr">$</span> blurt publish ./essays/own-your-words.md</span>
<span class="ln dim">  reading frontmatter…</span>
<span class="ln"><span class="yk">platforms:</span> bluesky · mastodon · x</span>
<span class="ln ok">  ✓ PUBLISHED_TO_3_PLATFORMS</span>
<span class="ln dim">  file kept at ./essays/own-your-words.md</span></pre>
  </div>
</div>
